title A throw-in back to the goalie
intro A teammate is on the sideline.

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player B-RB at 23.1, 66.6
  ball with B-RB

step
  caption A Blue teammate is about to throw the ball in.
  label B-RB Throw
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption They throw it to the goalie.
  ball to 9.5, 34
  arrow from B-RB to ball
  draw penalty-area left
  duration 1300

question
  prompt Can they pick up a throw from a teammate?
  answer No
  wrong Yes
  wrong Only outside the box
  wrong Only after a goal
  correct No pickup on a throw-in.
  why A goalie cannot pick up a throw-in from a teammate.

question
  prompt What should they do?
  answer Use their feet
  wrong Pick it up
  wrong Throw-in
  wrong Corner kick
  correct Use their feet.
  why They have to play it with their feet.

step
  caption The goalie cannot pick this one up.
  B-G to 9.5, 34
  ball with B-G
  label B-G Kick
  no-hands B-G
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption They kick it away with their feet.
  ball to 25.2, 27.2
  arrow from B-G to ball
  no-hands B-G
  draw penalty-area left
  banner No pickup
  duration 1200
